  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan forced.\n• Place peeled & chopped pumpkin on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over mixed sesame seeds, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80d4b511ee4a266ae26f/step-1896e500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While pumpkin is roasting, in a medium saucepan, heat the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and all the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80d4b511ee4a266ae26f/step-353f9f10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut plain tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm chunks.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes. Add sweet soy seasoning, drizzle of olive oil and cook, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80d4b511ee4a266ae26f/step-aa796320.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine slaw mix, garlic aioli and Japanese-style dressing. Season.\n• Divide rice between bowls.\n• Top with tofu, roast pumpkin and Japanese slaw.\n• Top with pickled ginger to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80d4b511ee4a266ae26f/step-fdb59130.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
